[{"_1":2},"routes/docs-slug",{"_3":4},"data",{"_5":6,"_7":8},"content","# Privacy-First AI\n\nYour creative work is precious. We believe your stories should remain private and under your control.\n\n## Local-First Architecture\n\nNovellis is built with a local-first philosophy. Your novel data, character sheets, and world settings are stored locally on your machine.\n\n## Ollama Integration\n\nFor maximum privacy, you can use **Ollama** to run Large Language Models locally. This ensures that NO data ever leaves your computer for analysis.\n","slug","privacy"]
